    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop are delighted to present to the market no. 9 Chipping Terrace. No.9 is a refurbished three bedroom duplex, well presented throughout and ready for immediate occupancy. The property benefits from a spacious southerly facing balcony and plenty of natural light throughout. The well proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hall, guest WC, storage room, separate sitting room, and a new kitchen/dining room. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a spacious main bedroom with en-suite, along with a family bathroom.\n\n Residents` parking is available to the front of the property.\n\n\nChipping Terrace is well serviced by excellent public transport links to Dublin City Centre, with Dublin Airport, the N3 and M50 all within easy reach. \nA selection of local primary and secondary schools, along with Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, are also nearby. Ongar Village is just a stones throw offering a wide range of amenities including supermarkets, restaurants, shops and a pharmacy.\n\n Viewing is highly recommend and is by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\nSpacious hall with new laminate flooring, guest WC and large storage area under the stairs.\n\nLIVING ROOM - 5.56m (18'3\") x 3.85m (12'8\") : 21.41 sqm (230 sqft)\nSeparate sitting room with new flooring, large windows and an indoor-outdoor feel, with double doors leading directly to the spacious south- west facing balcony.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM - 7.12m (23'4\") x 2.66m (8'9\") : 18.94 sqm (204 sqft)\nKitchen/dining room with new flooring and large windows providing plenty of natural light. A bright and practical space for everyday use.\n\nGUEST WC - 1.05m (3'5\") x 1.05m (3'5\") : 1.10 sqm (12 sqft)\nGuest WC with tiled splashback, privacy window and wash hand basin.\n\nBEDROOM - 3.7m (12'2\") x 5.55m (18'3\") : 20.54 sqm (221 sqft)\nSpacious main bedroom with en-suite, new carpet and ample storage.\n\nEN-SUITE - 0.09m (4\") x 2.45m (8'0\") : 0.22 sqm (2 sqft)\nPartially tiled en-suite, freshly painted with new flooring, wc and whb.\n\nDOUBLE BEDROOM - 3.09m (10'2\") x 3.98m (13'1\") : 12.30 sqm (132 sqft)\nFront double bedroom with built-in storage, large window and new carpets.\n\nBEDROOM - 2.35m (7'9\") x 2.95m (9'8\") : 6.93 sqm (75 sqft)\nLocated to the front of the property with with new carpets.\n\nBATHROOM - 2.45m (8'0\") x 1.09m (3'7\") : 2.67 sqm (29 sqft)\nPartially tiled main bathroom with wc, whb and bathtub with shower over.\n\nBALCONY\nPrivate south facing balcony situated off the living room.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Newly fitted kitchen </li><li> Freshly decorated with new floors throughout </li><li> South facing private balcony </li><li> Excellent B3 energy rating </li><li> All local amenities on the doorstep </li><li> Gas fired central heating </li><li> Ample parking</li></ul>"
      },
